#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:5
#: 2311d377e18b4695bfe9f9feadf60e65
msgid "Mission Planner Advanced Tools"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:7
#: 9b4de38147004078a7eb291f69803427
msgid "Mission Planner has many advanced tools which are normally hidden from the user. These can be accessed via pressing CTRL-F. Many have use only to developers or advanced users, but a few can be useful to regular users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:12
#: 70dda57e62a3448e81089612c3cc71b8
msgid "Some useful utilities are: MAVLink Inspector, BootLoader Upgrade, MAVLink (Forwarding), and Warning Manager."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:15
#: 3ad03e669d9046bd8be764d6df240e79
msgid "MAVLink Inspector"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:17
#: 12d2ac0afa35443f812a9a607ca4c6f8
msgid "This allows a real time inspection of the MAVLink values being sent. A user can see any measurement/reading being sent and normally stored in a TLOG, in real time. A user selected number of historical points of a data value can be graphed real-time also."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:23
#: 1901f4046b2b4fa69cf897eac29736e0
msgid "BootLoader Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:25
#: 22ef67627cb944bd9b2bce74e9aa767a
msgid "Often the boot loader supplied by an autopilot vendor may be out of date. Using this button will automatically update the autopilots bootloader. If it is already current, then no update will occur."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:28
#: a2a13a3017b44bad8446082d769afb59
msgid "Mavlink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:30
#: 806dbfaef5f847138fab2f10bca90309
msgid "This allows forwarding of your connected autopilots MAVLink stream via the internet to another user with a public IP address. This is often used by users to help another user debug issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:35
#: c4663e200a1349e2ac71540a1af16d60
msgid "Select this tool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:36
#: f6648334e43d4980a0aa63f4cbd62cce
msgid "Next a dialog will open with drop-downs to allow selection of communication port. For remote connections usually UDP will be chosen. For TCP or UDP, the baud rate selection box is unimportant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:37
#: 58c5ad30169e4587ab614cc8a42bcec3
msgid "Click this box if you want the remote party to be able to change parameters on you autopilot or control it remotely."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:38
#: 88483ef424344cb68666029125ab56ec
msgid "When \"Connect\" is selected, depending on communications port, the public IP address of the recipient and port dialogs will open for input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:40
#: 0fb311db81f445fc84235fced0b59341
msgid "After this, the remote site should start getting MAVLink packets from your autopilot. They can use whatever ground station they chose to receive them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:42
#: fa31bd5629534fe29149601ec3b4b59f
msgid "You can forward MAVLink packets to only one location."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:44
#: 50a688a497b04b00b01c5f6b49c97442
msgid "UDP is usually recommended instead of TCP since TCP requires acknowledgment of packets and network delays can slow down Joystick response to the point of causing crashes. UDP will continue to send control commands without waiting for acknowledgment of previous data reception."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:47
#: 59b371f20dd74e979d7e2b72f0f9cd2c
msgid "Forwarding Locally"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:49
#: 60cea7524bf247908559aa77bdcf4df5
msgid "You can also forward locally so that multiple ground control stations can connect to the locally attached autopilot on the same PC. In this case just use the local PC's localhost ip address of 127.0.0.1. You then can connect another GCS like MAVProxy or QGC on the same PC."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:52
#: 6f3e84d632044c7b9763c911bd52ec04
msgid "Warning Manager"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:54
#: 4e336d9c205843e79880978f404b8105
msgid "This allows the creation of custom audio warnings based on virtually any measurement/status reading being received over the MAVLink connection to the vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:59
#: a00c75b863e54e8b88657690d8503251
msgid "You can select an incoming data item from the drop-down list, and compare it against a limit and then have a phrase saved and spoken by Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
